{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++17 code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++17 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include<bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\nconst int INF = 0x3f3f3f3f;\nconst int TIME = 100;\nconst int MAXN = TIME * TIME;\nconst int MAXE = MAXN * TIME * 3;\n\nint head[MAXN], to[MAXE], cap[MAXE], cost[MAXE], nxt[MAXE];\nint dis[MAXN], inq[MAXN], pre[MAXN], pree[MAXN];\nint SRC, SNK, edges_cnt;\n\nvoid add_edge(int u, int v, int c, int w) {\n    to[edges_cnt] = v; cap[edges_cnt] = c; cost[edges_cnt] = w; nxt[edges_cnt] = head[u]; head[u] = edges_cnt++;\n    to[edges_cnt] = u; cap[edges_cnt] = 0; cost[edges_cnt] = -w; nxt[edges_cnt] = head[v]; head[v] = edges_cnt++;\n}\n\nint min_cost_flow() {\n    int total_cost = 0;\n    while (true) {\n        queue<int> q;\n        memset(dis, INF, sizeof(dis));\n        memset(inq, 0, sizeof(inq));\n        memset(pre, -1, sizeof(pre));\n        memset(pree, -1, sizeof(pree));\n        dis[SRC] = 0;\n        q.push(SRC);\n        inq[SRC] = 1;\n        while (!q.empty()) {\n            int u = q.front(); q.pop();\n            inq[u] = 0;\n            for (int e = head[u]; e != -1; e = nxt[e]) {\n                int v = to[e];\n                if (cap[e] > 0 && dis[v] > dis[u] + cost[e]) {\n                    dis[v] = dis[u] + cost[e];\n                    pre[v] = u;\n                    pree[v] = e;\n                    if (!inq[v]) {\n                        inq[v] = 1;\n                        q.push(v);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        if (dis[SNK] >= INF) break;\n        int add = INF;\n        for (int v = SNK; v != SRC; v = pre[v]) add = min(add, cap[pree[v]]);\n        for (int v = SNK; v != SRC; v = pre[v]) {\n            cap[pree[v]] -= add;\n            cap[pree[v] ^ 1] += add;\n        }\n        total_cost += dis[SNK] * add;\n    }\n    return total_cost;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    memset(head, -1, sizeof(head));\n    int n, m, k, c, d;\n    scanf(\"%d%d%d%d%d\", &n, &m, &k, &c, &d);\n    SRC = 0;\n    SNK = n * TIME + 1;\n    for (int i = 1; i <= TIME; ++i) add_edge(i, SNK, 100, 0);\n    for (int i = 0, v; i < k; ++i) {\n        scanf(\"%d\", &v);\n        add_edge(SRC, (v - 1) * TIME + 1, 1, 0);\n    }\n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i)\n        for (int t = 1; t < TIME; ++t)\n            add_edge((i - 1) * TIME + t, (i - 1) * TIME + t + 1, 100, c);\n    for (int i = 0; i < m; ++i) {\n        int u, v;\n        scanf(\"%d%d\", &u, &v);\n        for (int t = 1; t < TIME; ++t) {\n            int from_u = (u - 1) * TIME + t;\n            int to_v = (v - 1) * TIME + t + 1;\n            int from_v = (v - 1) * TIME + t;\n            int to_u = (u - 1) * TIME + t + 1;\n            for (int p = 1; p <= 50; ++p) {\n                int w = c + (p * p - (p - 1) * (p - 1)) * d;\n                add_edge(from_u, to_v, 1, w);\n                add_edge(from_v, to_u, 1, w);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", min_cost_flow());\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\nfrom collections import deque\n\nINF = 0x3f3f3f3f\nTIME = 100\n\ndef solve():\n    data = list(map(int, sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()))\n    it = iter(data)\n    n = next(it); m = next(it); k = next(it); c = next(it); d = next(it)\n    \n    SRC = 0\n    SNK = n * TIME + 1\n    nodes = SNK + 1\n    \n    adj = [[] for _ in range(nodes)]\n    edges = []  # each edge: [to, cap, cost]\n    \n    def add_edge(u, v, cap, cost):\n        # forward edge\n        edges.append([v, cap, cost])\n        adj[u].append(len(edges) - 1)\n        # reverse edge\n        edges.append([u, 0, -cost])\n        adj[v].append(len(edges) - 1)\n    \n    # connect first person's time nodes to sink\n    for t in range(1, TIME + 1):\n        add_edge(t, SNK, 100, 0)\n    \n    # source to starting positions\n    for _ in range(k):\n        v = next(it)\n        add_edge(SRC, (v - 1) * TIME + 1, 1, 0)\n    \n    # stay edges\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        for t in range(1, TIME):\n            u = (i - 1) * TIME + t\n            v = (i - 1) * TIME + t + 1\n            add_edge(u, v, 100, c)\n    \n    # movement edges\n    for _ in range(m):\n        u = next(it); v = next(it)\n        for t in range(1, TIME):\n            from_u = (u - 1) * TIME + t\n            to_v = (v - 1) * TIME + t + 1\n            from_v = (v - 1) * TIME + t\n            to_u = (u - 1) * TIME + t + 1\n            for p in range(1, 51):\n                w = c + (p * p - (p - 1) * (p - 1)) * d\n                add_edge(from_u, to_v, 1, w)\n                add_edge(from_v, to_u, 1, w)\n    \n    # min cost flow\n    total_cost = 0\n    while True:\n        dis = [INF] * nodes\n        inq = [0] * nodes\n        pre = [-1] * nodes\n        pree = [-1] * nodes\n        dis[SRC] = 0\n        q = deque([SRC])\n        inq[SRC] = 1\n        while q:\n            u = q.popleft()\n            inq[u] = 0\n            for e_idx in adj[u]:\n                v, cap, cost = edges[e_idx]\n                if cap > 0 and dis[v] > dis[u] + cost:\n                    dis[v] = dis[u] + cost\n                    pre[v] = u\n                    pree[v] = e_idx\n                    if not inq[v]:\n                        inq[v] = 1\n                        q.append(v)\n        if dis[SNK] >= INF:\n            break\n        add = INF\n        v = SNK\n        while v != SRC:\n            add = min(add, edges[pree[v]][1])\n            v = pre[v]\n        v = SNK\n        while v != SRC:\n            e_idx = pree[v]\n            edges[e_idx][1] -= add\n            edges[e_idx ^ 1][1] += add\n            v = pre[v]\n        total_cost += dis[SNK] * add\n    \n    print(total_cost)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-1.9907753085135482e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0005648924270644784, -0.0019369428046047688, 0.0, -3.802703940891661e-05, -0.0002627027570270002, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.00016175392374861985, -0.20145222544670105, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -1.6689160474925302e-05, -0.6974771022796631, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.0015026956098154187, -4.768370445162873e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -7.152555099310121e-07, 0.0, -0.03850631043314934, -5.125986263010418e-06, -0.0003343261778354645, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.03026660345494747, -0.0008740180637687445, -0.45267975330352783, -0.5759604573249817, -9.536738616588991e-07, -2.312633478140924e-05, 0.0, -0.018160613253712654, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -7.486063259420916e-05, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -0.38805603981018066, 0.0, -4.541770613286644e-05, 0.0, -3.9219088648678735e-05, -1.6689160474925302e-05, -1.3589766240329482e-05, -0.0011701886542141438, -1.0728830375228426e-06, 0.0, -0.576018214225769, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.145764938177308e-06, -1.311301275563892e-06, 0.0, -6.43728071